return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'ms_MY','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.2','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:28+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:28+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'Dihantar apabila anda menekan Dayakan Babilim, dan sekali lagi jika tapak perlu mendaftar semula: URL tapak anda, versi WordPress, PHP dan Babilim, bahasa tapak anda dan bahasa yang digunakan padanya, serta kunci awam yang dijana untuk tapak ini.','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'Dihantar pada setiap semakan: senarai pemalam dan tema yang dipasang beserta status mana-mana terjemahan Babilim yang dipasang untuknya, bahasa yang digunakan, dan kod diagnostik ringkas.','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'Setiap permintaan menyertakan URL tapak anda, dan token akses tapak turut disertakan apabila perkhidmatan memerlukannya.','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Apa yang Babilim hantar kepada perkhidmatan','Your site\'s URL'=>'URL tapak anda','WordPress version'=>'Versi WordPress','PHP version'=>'Versi PHP','Babilim version'=>'Versi Babilim','Your site\'s language'=>'Bahasa tapak anda','Languages in use on your site'=>'Bahasa yang digunakan pada tapak anda','A public key for this site'=>'Kunci awam untuk tapak ini','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'Kunci awam yang dijana untuk tapak ini, digunakan untuk membuktikan permintaan be